 of resources by  Chief Operating Decision Makers &amp;  internal business reporting system for evaluation of operational results. On 30.10.2024,  Co. had raised funds by way of Qualified Institutional Placement in terms of Chapter VI of SEBI ICDR, 2018 (as amended) and  applicable provisions of  Act and allotted 2,72,85,129 equity shares of face value Rs5 each to  eligible qualified institutional buyers at a price of Rs146.60 per share (including a premium of Rs141.60 per share) aggregating to Rs40,000 lakhs.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
